msgid "Kavenegar: token, token2, token3, token10, token20. IPPanel/Panelchi/MaxSMS/Faraz/SMS.ir: exact approved variable names. Meli Payamak: variables in template order. Custom gateway: uses the message text and its {message} transport placeholder."
